{"ID":"20230928083359-15qj21q","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20230928083359-15qj21q","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928083359-15qj21q\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928083408-sb3791d\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928083513-9q75p1y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:217,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928083513-9q75p1y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"【正经】【足少阳胆经】","type":"doc","updated":"20240912173946"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240912165610-1mt4hrr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240912165610-1mt4hrr","updated":"20240912173941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【足少阳胆经穴位】：瞳子髎穴、听会穴、上关穴、颔厌穴、悬颅穴、悬厘穴、曲鬓穴、率谷穴、天冲穴、浮白穴、头窍阴穴、完骨穴、本神穴、阳白穴、头临泣穴、目窗穴、正营穴、承灵穴、脑空穴、风池穴、肩井穴、渊腋穴、辄筋穴、日月穴、京门穴、带脉穴、五枢穴、维道穴、居髎穴、环跳穴、风市穴、中渎穴、膝阳关穴、阳陵泉穴、阳交穴、外丘穴、光明穴、阳辅穴、悬钟穴、丘墟穴、足临泣穴、地五会穴、侠溪穴、足窍阴穴。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20230928083408-sb3791d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083408-sb3791d","updated":"20230928083415"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肝把营养物质吸收后，浊物进入胆，胆的浊物进入小肠；肝胆属木，木生火，所以胆的浊物进入小肠会旺小肠火，加强小肠消化力；心脏一直搏动，心包膜又络到胆上面，所以心脏的搏动会让胆规律性地喷出胆汁，胆汁喷射的速度就是心脏搏动的速度；胆堵塞在持续的心包搏动下也会提高压力，把堵塞的位置冲开；（所以处理胆病，加强心脏，用药把胆汁清理出来，同时增强肝脏代谢能力，提供更多的胆汁增加压力）"}]},{"ID":"20230928083408-vg5qicv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083408-vg5qicv","updated":"20230928083416"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"所以，胆木会生火，是因为心火去推胆木，胆汁的木才会下去生小肠的火；所以阳跟着阳生，阴跟着阴生，肝木生心火，胆木生阳火；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083408-5jr6p7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083408-5jr6p7y","updated":"20230928083417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"丹为清静之官，中正之官，决断出焉；吐伤，视物倒之（视物倒之是左右翻转，不是上下颠倒，例b看成d）；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083408-u0d81hb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083408-u0d81hb","updated":"20230928083418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胆经，临床上呕吐口苦，因为阳木生火时，任何东西烧焦味道都是苦味；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083420-vgz700f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083420-vgz700f"}},{"ID":"20230928083408-4bospvz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083408-4bospvz","updated":"20230928083435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"上关穴：手足少阳、阳明的会穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083408-1ctw47v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083408-1ctw47v","updated":"20230928083435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"井\t金\t足窍阴穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928083408-m4pm78m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083408-m4pm78m","updated":"20230928083436"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"荣\t水\t侠溪穴\t母穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928083408-8q9bfkk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083408-8q9bfkk","updated":"20230928083437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"俞\t木\t临泣穴\t本穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928083408-o1poysc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083408-o1poysc","updated":"20230928083437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"经\t火\t阳辅穴\t子穴\t\t治实症"}]},{"ID":"20230928083408-eys83od","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083408-eys83od","updated":"20230928083438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"合\t土\t阳陵泉\t合穴"}]},{"ID":"20230928083408-qggxuw1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083408-qggxuw1","updated":"20230928083438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"日月穴：胆经的募穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083408-v9zsjyq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083408-v9zsjyq","updated":"20230928083439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"京门穴：肾的募穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083408-k8nlzw5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083408-k8nlzw5","updated":"20230928083440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"风市穴：中医瘫痪大穴；（中风大穴）"}]},{"ID":"20230928083408-6gefqed","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083408-6gefqed","updated":"20230928083441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中渎穴：少阳的一个别络；（能增强风市穴的效果；中渎穴能治的风市穴都能治）"}]},{"ID":"20230928083408-561ifsi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083408-561ifsi","updated":"20230928083442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"阳陵泉：筋会阳陵泉；（中风大穴）"}]},{"ID":"20230928083408-f4j682k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083408-f4j682k","updated":"20230928083445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胆石点穴（位于阳陵泉正下一寸）：对症治疗胆结石；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083408-x8i8i71","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083408-x8i8i71","updated":"20230928083446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"外丘穴：足少阳胆经络穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083408-ydsh1zf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083408-ydsh1zf","updated":"20230928083447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"光明穴：足少阳经络穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083408-wxg9dwc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083408-wxg9dwc","updated":"20230928083448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"悬钟穴（也叫绝骨穴）：髓会绝骨；（绝骨穴也是治疗中风的大穴）"}]},{"ID":"20230928083408-3xuryno","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083408-3xuryno","updated":"20230928083448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"丘墟穴：足少阳胆经的原穴；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083408-vmaq01g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083408-vmaq01g","updated":"20230928083449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"临泣穴：主治带脉；"}]},{"ID":"20230928083508-666171k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083508-666171k","updated":"20230928083508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"足少阳胆经"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/足少阳胆经-20230928083508-t9ru6pb.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20230928083513-9q75p1y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928083513-9q75p1y","updated":"20230928083513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"足少阳胆经1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/足少阳胆经1-20230928083513-09emcxq.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240912173945-857zjx0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240912173945-857zjx0"}},{"ID":"20240912173946-8xddvs1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240912173946-8xddvs1"}}]}